## Final tree measurements, base 5735d7a (write batching). head2 = 5735d7a; all2 = + the four audit patches; aes = all2 + the AES key hash.
## abseq.sh: one slot (server vCPU 2, kvbench 8 threads x 32 connections x 16 in flight on vCPUs 16-23), quads of A B B A, server CPU per request (schedstat).

# 16,384-byte values: A = head2, B = all2
quad 1: A    85,490 req/s  11931 ns/req (runs 12479, 11383; busy 1.00) | B   177,014 req/s   5806 ns/req (runs 5776, 5836; busy 1.02) | B/A CPU 0.487 req/s 2.071 errors+bad 0
quad 2: A    88,402 req/s  11694 ns/req (runs 11550, 11838; busy 1.03) | B   175,903 req/s   5877 ns/req (runs 5934, 5821; busy 1.03) | B/A CPU 0.503 req/s 1.990 errors+bad 0
